 written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le13ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "the medical profession"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "all the different types of doctors of medicine"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The medical profession is one of the best examples of a career field that includes more women now than it did before.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob06aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about people who work in medicine."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to stay single"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to not get married"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Many women are now staying single longer and having families later in life."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob06aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "approximately"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "around, about"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: In the United States, approximately one third of doctors are women today. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob06aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "caregiver"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone who takes care of another person, such as a young child or an elderly person"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Women have proven themselves to be patient and trustworthy caregivers. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob06aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "nursing care "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "assistance for people who need help for a variety of reasons (sickness, age, disability, etc.)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Women have provided nursing care for centuries. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob06aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to figure"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be part of something; to be recognized for something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Men have figured more prominently in the written history of medicine."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob06aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be involved"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to participate in something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Historically, women have been more involved in healthcare than men. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob06aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Present Perfect vs. Simple Past Tenses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Present Perfect tense to talk about generalities from past which are relevant at present. <br />  You use the Simple Past tense to talk about a finished action or event not connected to the present."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use the Present Perfect there is a connection between what happened in the past and now. You use time markers like for, since and ever with the Present Perfect. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use the Simple Past, the time is always past. You use time markers with the past like: then, ago, yesterday, when I was\u2026 with the Simple Past. To form the Present Perfect tense, you use have/has + the past participle of the base form of the verb."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Historically, women have been more involved in health care than men."}, {"type": "example", "content": "They have proven themselves to be patient and trustworthy caregivers."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Comparatives and Superlatives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use comparative adjectives to compare yourself to another      person. <br> You use a superlative adjectives to compare yourself or          something to a group of people."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can compare things using the words <span class=\"italic\">more (than)</span> or <span class=\"italic\">less (than)</span>.  <br> You can also use adjectives to compare things. Some adjectives        change to different words in the comparative and superlative form.<br> With one syllable words, you add <span class=\"strong\">-er</span> to the adjective to make the       comparative form. You add <span class=\"strong\">-est</span> to the adjective to make the         superlative form.  <br> With words of two or more syllables, you add the word more before          the adjective or adverb in the comparative form. You add <span class=\"italic\">the most</span>      before the adjective or the adverb in the superlative form."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective or  Adverb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Comparative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Superlative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"--\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"more\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the most\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"--\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"less\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the least\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"good\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"better\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the best\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"fast\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"faster\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the fastest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"involved\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" more involved\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the most involved\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"prominently\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"more prominently\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the most prominently\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"accurately\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" more accurately\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the most accurately\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "The medical profession is one of the best examples of a career field that includes more women now than it did before. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Men have figured more prominently in the written history of medicine because most of the old manuscripts found have been written by men."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose 10 different countries."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Go online. Find out the percentage of female doctors in each country."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write your list in order from the most (#1) to the least (#10)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss your list with a partner. Together, try to explain the results."}]}, {"